{"unit_id":"baixianger__dsh-bridge#card-zh","repo":"baixianger/dsh-bridge","commit":"3e4605e3aeae57419a0a3299f560d2ccb0226241","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bridge 是一款为 DSH 提供同一主机内会话通信的插件，通过三个工具接入 agent：session_list 列出可通信的活动会话，session_send 可按会话 ID 或标题发送消息，session_messages 查看当前会话收到的近期消息。它能解析在线和已保存会话、恢复离线目标，并对并发恢复与重复消息 ID 做处理；还提供供本地服务和可信传输调用的消息接口。适合在一个 DSH 主机内协调多个会话，或供聊天传输插件复用本地投递。近期记录和去重表保存在内存中，重载后清空；无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-82","lib/index.js:88-118","lib/index.js:120-217","lib/index.js:229-357"]}
{"unit_id":"baixianger__dsh-bridge#card-en","repo":"baixianger/dsh-bridge","commit":"3e4605e3aeae57419a0a3299f560d2ccb0226241","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bridge adds same-host messaging to DSH with tools to list active sessions, send messages by ID or title, and read recent deliveries. It can resume saved sessions and provides a delivery service for local integrations. Recent message history remains in memory and clears when the plugin reloads.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-82","lib/index.js:88-118","lib/index.js:120-217","lib/index.js:229-357"]}
